<!DOCTYPE reference
  PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 2.x Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="_Toc235450413" xml:lang="en-us">
   <title>Scenario 7 — Image inside a table cell</title>
   <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <keyword>inside</keyword>
        <keyword>table</keyword>
        <keyword>Error</keyword>
        <keyword>image</keyword>
        <keyword>media</keyword>
        <keyword>Image</keyword>
        <indexterm>inside</indexterm>
        <indexterm>table</indexterm>
        <indexterm>Error</indexterm>
      </keywords>
      <prodinfo>
        <prodname></prodname>
      </prodinfo>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
   <refbody>
      <section id="sec_d767e7">
         <p>Consider a table where the author has inserted an <codeph>&lt;img&gt;</codeph> element directly inside a <codeph>&lt;td&gt;</codeph> cell — for example, a status icon or screenshot thumbnail.</p>
         <table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
            <title>Image inside a table cell</title>
            <tgroup cols="2">
               <colspec colname="c1"/>
               <colspec colname="c2"/>
               <thead>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <b>HTML Input</b>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>
                        <b>DITA Output</b>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
               </thead>
               <tbody>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock id="codeblock_dsq_yxn_lkc">
&lt;table>
  &lt;tr>
    &lt;th>Status&lt;/th>
    &lt;th>Icon&lt;/th>
    &lt;th>Description&lt;/th>
  &lt;/tr>
  &lt;tr>
    &lt;td>OK&lt;/td>
    &lt;td>
      &lt;img src="media/ok_icon.png" alt="OK icon"/>
    &lt;/td>
    &lt;td>System running.&lt;/td>
  &lt;/tr>
  &lt;tr>
    &lt;td>Error&lt;/td>
    &lt;td>
      &lt;img src="media/err_icon.png" alt="Error icon"/>
    &lt;/td>
    &lt;td>Error detected.&lt;/td>
  &lt;/tr>
&lt;/table></codeblock>
                     </entry>
<entry>
                        <codeblock id="codeblock_fty_yxn_lkc">
&lt;simpletable>
  &lt;sthead>
    &lt;stentry>Status&lt;/stentry>
    &lt;stentry>Icon&lt;/stentry>
    &lt;stentry>Description&lt;/stentry>
  &lt;/sthead>
  &lt;strow>
    &lt;stentry>OK&lt;/stentry>
    &lt;stentry>
      &lt;image href="media/ok_icon.png" placement="inline"/>
    &lt;/stentry>
    &lt;stentry>System running.&lt;/stentry>
  &lt;/strow>
  &lt;strow>
    &lt;stentry>Error&lt;/stentry>
    &lt;stentry>
      &lt;image href="media/err_icon.png" placement="inline"/>
    &lt;/stentry>
    &lt;stentry>Error detected.&lt;/stentry>
  &lt;/strow>
&lt;/simpletable></codeblock>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
               </tbody>
            </tgroup>
         </table>

         <p>
            <b>Result:</b> Inline <codeph>&lt;img&gt;</codeph> elements inside table cells are extracted and mapped to <codeph>&lt;image placement="inline"/&gt;</codeph> inside the corresponding <codeph>&lt;stentry&gt;</codeph>. The <codeph>src</codeph> attribute value is mapped to the <codeph>href</codeph> attribute on the DITA <codeph>&lt;image&gt;</codeph> element. For more information on image handling, see the <xref href="../images_and_graphics/images_and_graphics.dita" format="dita">Images and Graphics</xref> section.</p>
      </section>
   </refbody>
